  "categorias": "Noticias|Sucesos",
  "post_content": "<p>(17 fotos) Poco despu&eacute;s de las 17 horas de este jueves se ha producido un espectacular accidente sin heridos cuando un veh&iacute;culo Dacia Duster que circulaba por la calle R&iacute;o Mijares de Onda ha sufrido el impacto lateral de un todoterreno Hyundai que se ha saltado el Ceda el paso de la calle Alzira, seg&uacute;n testigos presenciales.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/10/IMG-20151008-WA0014.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 288px;\" /></p>\n<p>Los dos conductores han salido ilesos, pero el Dacia ha impactado levemente con un monovolumen tambi&eacute;n Hyundai, aparcado en la esquina contraria. Los bomberos han tendio que limpiar el suelo, donde se hab&iacute;a derramado agua destilada y aceite del todoterreno Hyundai. Tambi&eacute;n ha tenido que intervenir la Polic&iacute;a Local para regular el tr&aacute;fico y realizar el atestado.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcarrersalzirariumillarsonda/img-20151008-wa0014.jpg\" alt=\"img-20151008-wa0014\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcarrersalzirariumillarsonda/p1180404.jpg\" alt=\"p1180404\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcarrersalzirariumillarsonda/p1180405.jpg\" alt=\"p1180405\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcarrersalzirariumillarsonda/p1180407.jpg\" alt=\"p1180407\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcarrersalzirariumillarsonda/p1180408.jpg\" alt=\"p1180408\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcarrersalzirariumillarsonda/p1180409.jpg\" alt=\"p1180409\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcarrersalzirariumillarsonda/p1180410.jpg\" alt=\"p1180410\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcarrersalzirariumillarsonda/p1180411.jpg\" alt=\"p1180411\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcarrersalzirariumillarsonda/p1180414.jpg\" alt=\"p1180414\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcarrersalzirariumillarsonda/p1180416.jpg\" alt=\"p1180416\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcarrersalzirariumillarsonda/p1180417.jpg\" alt=\"p1180417\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcarrersalzirariumillarsonda/p1180418.jpg\" alt=\"p1180418\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcarrersalzirariumillarsonda/p1180419.jpg\" alt=\"p1180419\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcarrersalzirariumillarsonda/p1180420.jpg\" alt=\"p1180420\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcarrersalzirariumillarsonda/p1180421.jpg\" alt=\"p1180421\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcarrersalzirariumillarsonda/p1180422.jpg\" alt=\"p1180422\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcarrersalzirariumillarsonda/p1180423.jpg\" alt=\"p1180423\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
